  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed70aee8cc8cd4f8ca7ec0b6c7dc5db3, type: 3}
  m_Name: EndingPauseJourney
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Northbound.Runtime::Northbound.Dialogue.DialogueAsset
  id: ending_pause_journey
  lines:
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: Friday arrives, and Jamie does not turn the key.
    textChinese: "\u661F\u671F\u4E94\u5230\u4E86\uFF0C\u6770\u7C73\u6CA1\u6709\u8F6C\u52A8\u94A5\u5319\u3002"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Elias
    text: So this is a no?
    textChinese: "\u6240\u4EE5\uFF0C\u4F60\u7684\u7B54\u6848\u662F\u4E0D\u8D70\uFF1F"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: Not no. Not yet, and not like this.
    textChinese: "\u4E0D\u662F\u4E0D\u8D70\u3002\u53EA\u662F\u8FD8\u4E0D\u662F\u73B0\u5728\uFF0C\u4E5F\u4E0D\u80FD\u7528\u8FD9\u79CD\u65B9\u5F0F\u8D70\u3002"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    text: The five of them watch the departure time pass without pretending nothing
      changed.
    textChinese: "\u4E94\u4E2A\u4EBA\u4E00\u8D77\u770B\u7740\u539F\u5B9A\u7684\u51FA\u53D1\u65F6\u95F4\u8FC7\u53BB\uFF0C\u6CA1\u6709\u5047\u88C5\u4E00\u5207\u4ECD\u548C\u4ECE\u524D\u4E00\u6837\u3002"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    text: On the rooftop, Jamie draws a new chalk line with no date beside it.
    textChinese: "\u5C4B\u9876\u4E0A\uFF0C\u6770\u7C73\u91CD\u65B0\u753B\u4E86\u4E00\u6761\u7C89\u7B14\u7EBF\uFF0C\u65C1\u8FB9\u6CA1\u6709\u5199\u65E5\u671F\u3002"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
